{"type":"message","id":"7019562e","parentId":"d9be04d8","timestamp":"2026-03-30T23:00:04.321Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:de62862d-0431-460a-93d4-a21c9c54aa7c notion-daily-briefing] Run 'python3 /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py'. Then produce a concise Korean briefing for Sam: max 25 items (top priority first), include category counts and immediate actions. Keep under 3500 characters for Telegram delivery.\nCurrent time: Tuesday, March 31st, 2026 — 8:00 AM (Asia/Seoul) / 2026-03-30 23:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1774911604311}}
{"type":"message","id":"9ac4c142","parentId":"7019562e","timestamp":"2026-03-30T23:00:09.619Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to run a cron job that executes a Python script and then produce a concise Korean briefing for Sam. Let me break down what I need to do:\n\n1. First, I need to read the Python script to understand what it does\n2. Run the script\n3. Produce a Korean briefing based on the output\n\nThe user wants:\n- Max 25 items (top priority first)\n- Include category counts and immediate actions\n- Keep under 3500 characters for Telegram delivery\n- Plain text format\n\nLet me start by reading the script to understand what it does.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0316b3cf14da434f8c951a18","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":16388,"output":265,"cacheRead":3908,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20561,"cost":{"input":0.0098328,"output":0.0005830000000000001,"cacheRead":0.00042988,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01084568}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774911604320,"responseId":"20260331070005cf91425e87624de4"}}
{"type":"message","id":"24645c39","parentId":"9ac4c142","timestamp":"2026-03-30T23:00:09.646Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0316b3cf14da434f8c951a18","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import requests\nimport json\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta, timezone\n\ndef fetch_daily_notion_tasks(token, database_id):\n    # Set timezone to Asia/Seoul (UTC+9)\n    KST = timezone(timedelta(hours=9))\n    now = datetime.now(KST)\n    \n    # Calculate range: Yesterday 07:00 KST to Today 07:00 KST\n    # If currently it's 08:00 KST, \"Today 07:00\" is 1 hour ago.\n    # \"Yesterday 07:00\" is 25 hours ago.\n    today_07 = now.replace(hour=7, minute=0, second=0, microsecond=0)\n    if now < today_07:\n        # If run before 07:00 (unlikely for an 08:00 cron), adjust\n        today_07 -= timedelta(days=1)\n    \n    yesterday_07 = today_07 - timedelta(days=1)\n    \n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n        \"Notion-Version\": \"2022-06-28\",\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n    }\n    \n    # Query database with filter on created_time\n    # Notion created_time is in ISO 8601 UTC.\n    url = f\"https://api.notion.com/v1/databases/{database_id}/query\"\n    \n    filter_data = {\n        \"filter\": {\n            \"and\": [\n                {\n                    \"timestamp\": \"created_time\",\n                    \"created_time\": {\n                        \"on_or_after\": yesterday_07.isoformat()\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"timestamp\": \"created_time\",\n                    \"created_time\": {\n                        \"before\": today_07.isoformat()\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    }\n    \n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=filter_data)\n    if response.status_code != 200:\n        return f\"Error: {response.text}\"\n    \n    results = response.json().get(\"results\", [])\n    if not results:\n        return \"전날 07시부터 당일 07시 사이에 새로 등록된 항목이 없습니다. 🌌\"\n    \n    report = f\"📅 **{yesterday_07.strftime('%m/%d %H:%M')} ~ {today_07.strftime('%m/%d %H:%M')} 노션 업무 요약**\\n\\n\"\n    \n    for i, page in enumerate(results, 1):\n        props = page.get(\"properties\", {})\n        \n        # Extract fields\n        category = props.get(\"Category\", {}).get(\"select\", {}).get(\"name\", \"N/A\")\n        \n        task_list = props.get(\"Task\", {}).get(\"title\", [])\n        task = task_list[0].get(\"plain_text\", \"N/A\") if task_list else \"N/A\"\n        \n        from_list = props.get(\"From\", {}).get(\"rich_text\", [])\n        sender = from_list[0].get(\"plain_text\", \"N/A\") if from_list else \"N/A\"\n        \n        summary_list = props.get(\"Summary\", {}).get(\"rich_text\", [])\n        summary = summary_list[0].get(\"plain_text\", \"N/A\") if summary_list else \"N/A\"\n        \n        report += f\"{i}. **[{category}]** {task}\\n\"\n        report += f\"   - **발신**: {sender}\\n\"\n        report += f\"   - **요약**: {summary}\\n\\n\"\n        \n    return report\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    TOKEN = \"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\"\n    DB_ID = \"00807fb0163d406c969699eb61a2e761\"\n    print(fetch_daily_notion_tasks(TOKEN, DB_ID))\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774911609642}}
{"type":"message","id":"aed9b983","parentId":"24645c39","timestamp":"2026-03-30T23:00:13.986Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the script fetches daily tasks from Notion. It looks for items created between yesterday 07:00 KST and today 07:00 KST. The script has a hardcoded token and database ID.\n\nThe script will return:\n- A report with date range\n- Each item with: number, category, task, sender, and summary\n- If no items found, returns a message saying no items\n\nLet me run this script now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3cb46cea8ca2407bb31c4496","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":835,"output":214,"cacheRead":20439,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21488,"cost":{"input":0.0005009999999999999,"output":0.0004708,"cacheRead":0.00224829,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00322009}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774911609647,"responseId":"2026033107001067e29359eb3347c2"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d558d808","parentId":"aed9b983","timestamp":"2026-03-30T23:00:24.001Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3cb46cea8ca2407bb31c4496","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📅 **03/30 07:00 ~ 03/31 07:00 노션 업무 요약**\n\n1. **[BAU]** N/A\n   - **발신**: Juyoung.Chae <Juyoung.Chae@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: 2026년 3월 31일에 예정된 GenAI 프로젝트 사전 킥오프 회의에 Derek 님이 불참한다는 공지입니다. 회의 참석자들은 해당 내용을 참고하시기 바랍니다.\n\n2. **[Infrastructure]** N/A\n   - **발신**: Cecilia.cha <Cecilia.cha@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: Ezywine 시스템 폐기 및 Xero 마이그레이션 진행 상황을 공유하며, 서버 업그레이드 일정을 고려한 신속한 대응을 요청했습니다. 마이그레이션 관련 장애 요인 파악 및 이해관계자 협의가 필요합니다.\n\n3. **[BAU]** N/A\n   - **발신**: Hyojin.Kw <Hyojin.K1@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: AI 기반 업무 자동화 프로젝트의 우선협상대상자 선정을 위한 제안 발표회 일정을 안내했습니다. 4월 3일 오후 3시 50분부터 본사 DPC 룸에서 진행됩니다.\n\n4. **[BAU]** N/A\n   - **발신**: \"Jay.Choi\" <Jay.Choi@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: 4월 3일로 예정된 업체 제안 발표회 시간이 인사팀 미팅과 겹쳐 참석이 어렵다는 의사를 전달했습니다. 일정 조정이나 확인이 필요합니다.\n\n5. **[BAU]** N/A\n   - **발신**: \"HyungSaeng.Park\" <HyungSaeng.Park@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: 2026년 3월 30일자 일일 모니터링 결과 특이사항 없이 정상임을 보고하는 내용입니다.\n\n6. **[Workplace]** N/A\n   - **발신**: Sam.Yeo <Sam.Yeo@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: 휴가 연락에 대한 회신 메일입니다.\n\n7. **[Infrastructure]** N/A\n   - **발신**: Cass Zero <8FVIPLounge@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: 'Korea SDWAN Support' 회의 요청이 수락되었습니다.\n\n8. **[Security]** N/A\n   - **발신**: Jinsan.Park <Jinsan.Park@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: Onetrust와 Azure SQL 연동 관련하여 개인정보보호법(PIPA) 준수를 위한 조치 사항 안내입니다. 국외 이전 고지, 보안 인증 확인 및 변경 관리 절차 수행이 필요합니다.\n\n9. **[BAU]** N/A\n   - **발신**: 신수용 <syshin2@edentns.com>\n   - **요약**: 4월 3일 금요일 오후에 예정된 오비맥주 제안발표회 일정에 대한 확인 메일입니다. 이든티앤에스 측에서 발표를 준비하여 방문할 예정입니다.\n\n10. **[Infrastructure]** N/A\n   - **발신**: \"G, Devivaraprasad(GLOBAL-V)\" <DeviVaraprasad.G@ab-inbev.com>\n   - **요약**: 한국 지역 쉐어포인트 연결 문제(INC9472374)에 대한 긴급 대응 관련 회신입니다.\n\n11. **[BAU]** N/A\n   - **발신**: \"Hyojin.Kw\" <Hyojin.K1@ob.co.kr>\n   - **요약**: AI 기반 업무 자동화 프로젝트 제안 발표회 일정을 안내했습니다. 4월 3일 오후 1시 30분부